Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.72,0:02:37.89,OP,,0,0,0,,好胜其实是认真的证明
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.89,0:02:40.56,OP,,0,0,0,,但就算这么说 你也不会相信吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.56,0:02:43.10,OP,,0,0,0,,所谓的常识 有时只是枷锁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.10,0:02:45.81,OP,,0,0,0,,正因为未知 才更值得去挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.81,0:02:48.40,OP,,0,0,0,,是真正的武士 还是路边的小角色
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.40,0:02:50.90,OP,,0,0,0,,为了找到答案 我选择迎战
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.90,0:02:56.20,OP,,0,0,0,,心中燃烧的热情如闪电般耀眼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.95,0:03:01.79,OP,,0,0,0,,无论你变成什么模样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.79,0:03:06.08,OP,,0,0,0,,并肩作战的意志绝不动摇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.08,0:03:10.92,OP,,0,0,0,,勇敢迎向未知的未来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.92,0:03:16.18,OP,,0,0,0,,只为遇见令人热血沸腾的新力量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.14,0:03:23.06,OP,,0,0,0,,来吧 用刀锋指向明天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.06,0:03:28.23,OP,,0,0,0,,唤醒内心温柔的强悍
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.23,0:03:33.11,OP,,0,0,0,,此刻沸腾燃烧的命运
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.11,0:03:37.53,OP,,0,0,0,,将绝望的气息一刀斩断
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.53,0:03:39.45,OP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}用这把“真剑”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.61,0:22:28.12,ED,,0,0,0,,被酸甜的雷电击中 内心翻腾
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.41,0:22:36.04,ED,,0,0,0,,未知的预感 第一次在心底悸动
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.83,0:22:40.63,ED,,0,0,0,,努力过后的冰淇淋奖励
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.76,0:22:44.68,ED,,0,0,0,,在特别的日子里分切的蛋糕
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.80,0:22:48.55,ED,,0,0,0,,彼此摆出美味的神情对视
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.68,0:22:51.64,ED,,0,0,0,,不小心笑了出来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.06,0:22:55.48,ED,,0,0,0,,这些闪闪发光的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.60,0:22:59.61,ED,,0,0,0,,希望能平凡地延续下去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.77,0:23:03.74,ED,,0,0,0,,像是在许愿 像是在祈祷
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.86,0:23:07.45,ED,,0,0,0,,细细地品味每一个瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.57,0:23:11.37,ED,,0,0,0,,在朴素的塔皮上
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.58,0:23:15.54,ED,,0,0,0,,你自由地点缀色彩
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.71,0:23:19.38,ED,,0,0,0,,真拿你没办法 离不开你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.50,0:23:24.22,ED,,0,0,0,,这股让人无法抗拒的悸动
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,（名古屋车站）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.32,0:00:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.66,0:00:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是味噌串炸吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.12,0:00:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,太好吃了呱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.16,0:00:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这我可以狂吃呱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.96,0:00:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,（串炸）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.41,0:00:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你在做什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.04,0:00:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不吃吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.13,0:00:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好不容易来到名古屋耶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.92,0:00:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我想拍张照片上传到IG
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.34,0:00:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.51,0:00:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,小心被老鹰叼走哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,真是一群悠哉的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.35,0:00:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,呱！你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你…你是蛞蝓男
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.07,0:00:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,才不是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.36,0:00:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我是侍奉鬼丸大人的八鬼之一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.74,0:00:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,蜗牛男
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.99,0:00:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,名字叫蜗蜗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.66,0:01:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,就只是多了个壳吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.21,0:01:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,又来了啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.42,0:01:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-快去拿盐巴过来\N-呱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.88,0:01:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就知道你的弱点咯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.93,0:01:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,吃我这招
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.22,0:01:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.85,0:01:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,现在蜗蜗我有壳保护 所以没效
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.82,0:01:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然有壳挡着没错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.78,0:01:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,但行动变慢也没意义吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.33,0:01:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,旋风剑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.58,0:01:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,真受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.17,0:01:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}-这家伙真的是鬼丸的手下吗？\N-我真的不敢了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.63,0:01:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,等下次遇到鬼丸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.38,0:01:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我就用必杀旋风剑打倒他
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.35,0:01:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,没那么简单
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.65,0:02:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,刃 摆出战斗架势
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.20,0:02:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙可能有点难对付
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.55,0:03:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什么人啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.05,0:04:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.47,0:04:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我是侍奉鬼丸大人的八鬼之一
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.52,0:04:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,德古拉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.31,0:04:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,把我的串炸还来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.11,0:04:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,名古屋真的是美食天堂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.91,0:04:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 雷霆男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.12,0:04:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,雷神剑是我们的世界之王
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.87,0:04:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,鬼丸大人才有资格拥有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.04,0:04:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本就不够格
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.04,0:04:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.21,0:04:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,在你吃苦头之前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.47,0:04:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,还是乖乖把雷神剑交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.14,0:04:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,抢得到就来试试看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.56,0:04:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,反正我也会用旋风剑打倒你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.18,0:04:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,好 男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.15,0:04:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,那就这么办
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.77,0:04:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我就靠蛮力来抢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.82,0:04:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,准备
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.49,0:05:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,开始
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.46,0:05:19.09,Default,,0,0,0,,太天真了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.88,0:05:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,危险呱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.93,0:05:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.39,0:05:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.31,0:05:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,飞在空中太卑鄙了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.32,0:05:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.23,0:05:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不会飞的人类才是可悲的生物
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.66,0:05:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.83,0:05:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,庄之介 我们上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.71,0:05:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,刃之…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.17,0:06:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.92,0:06:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 太棒了 雷霆男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.47,0:06:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但就算飞上了天 你还是赢不了我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.31,0:06:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.10,0:06:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那家伙速度好快
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.23,0:06:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的攻击根本打不到他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.90,0:06:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,但只要能连防御一起砍破\N胜机就来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.50,0:06:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好 用旋风剑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.88,0:06:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,刃之
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.68,0:06:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,旋风剑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.89,0:06:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.94,0:06:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这个样子没办法使出旋风剑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.94,0:07:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不经思考就乱挥是很蠢的行为
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.83,0:07:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一击
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.58,0:07:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.34,0:07:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,如此精湛的剑术
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.30,0:07:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底是何方神圣？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.35,0:07:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.14,0:07:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,古今无双
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.98,0:07:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,天下第一
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.15,0:07:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,让哭泣的小孩安静的风云人物
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.11,0:07:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,宫本武藏
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.07,0:07:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,就是我本人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.91,0:07:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是武藏宫本
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.91,0:07:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.00,0:07:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我的精神导师
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.42,0:08:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,能见到日本第一的大剑豪\N实在是非常幸运
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.30,0:08:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,真不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.47,0:08:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,请务必要加入我们阵营
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.64,0:08:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.27,0:08:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,武藏先生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.40,0:08:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,武藏先生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.73,0:08:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.49,0:08:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,呱！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.41,0:08:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,别…别过来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.71,0:08:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 漂亮女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.47,0:08:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,把雷霆男孩交出来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.10,0:08:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,大…大家
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,影虎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.06,0:09:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,表演开始咯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.65,0:09:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不要啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.86,0:09:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.70,0:09:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,色老头
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.49,0:09:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,庄之介！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.00,0:09:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,影虎 你一定要平安无事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.55,0:09:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,别想逃
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.07,0:09:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,庄之介！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.37,0:09:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.00,0:10:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,沙也加
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.92,0:10:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不要离开我身边哦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.56,0:10:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,逃得还挺快的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.44,0:10:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,雷霆男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.31,0:10:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.36,0:10:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}雷神剑最后一定会
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.49,0:10:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}来到我德古拉的手中
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.12,0:10:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,大家应该没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.46,0:10:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,刃？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.42,0:10:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,沙也加
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.34,0:10:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,-把那颗珠子给我\N-什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.17,0:10:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,只要有那颗珠子\N或许就能打倒那只蝙蝠男了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.47,0:10:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.18,0:11:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,因为
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.27,0:11:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你可能又会变回鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.89,0:11:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不会啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.56,0:11:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是有努力修行过的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.52,0:11:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经跟以前不一样了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.94,0:11:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}可是如果又变回那样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.99,0:11:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}到时候谁能阻止你？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.79,0:11:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那你说 我该怎么打败他？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.83,0:11:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,对方会飞 我连旋风剑都打不中
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.96,0:11:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这个…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.46,0:11:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,就算是为了大家\N我也一定得打败他才行
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.13,0:11:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.26,0:11:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,找到咯 雷霆男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.35,0:11:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-德古拉\N-你快退后
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.93,0:11:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这次不会再让你逃跑咯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.94,0:11:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,至于刚才的老虎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.15,0:11:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,应该也被武藏宫本他们抓住了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.86,0:11:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,快 乖乖把雷神剑交出来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.90,0:11:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,845、327
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.32,0:12:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,准备
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.53,0:12:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,哈…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.99,0:12:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,上！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.26,0:12:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶 用旋风剑一口气解决
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.26,0:12:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,休想得逞
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.14,0:12:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.89,0:12:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.98,0:12:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,有漂亮女孩在这 你逃不掉咯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.91,0:12:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.45,0:12:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,影虎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.12,0:12:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,原来你平安无事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.88,0:12:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,看来武藏宫本那边失败了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.76,0:13:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,只是在白费力气
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.14,0:13:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,怎…怎么办 刃？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.81,0:13:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,影虎 那边 往那边跑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.90,0:13:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（县厅 市政府）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.25,0:13:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,被发现也只是早晚的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.30,0:13:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,沙也加你看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.26,0:13:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我很帅吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.80,0:13:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你在做什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.22,0:13:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.52,0:13:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,怎…怎么办啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.30,0:14:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,躲猫猫就到此为止咯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.38,0:14:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,雷霆男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.05,0:14:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,还有漂亮女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.56,0:14:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,在这边
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.94,0:14:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就猜到你会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.82,0:14:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,有破绽
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.54,0:14:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,打中了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.04,0:15:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你竟敢…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.80,0:15:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶 被挡下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.51,0:15:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,果然还是得靠旋风剑才行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.01,0:15:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,竟敢把我最重要的墨镜给…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.72,0:15:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经彻底惹毛了我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.52,0:15:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,雷霆男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.04,0:15:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.39,0:15:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,还真是难缠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.51,0:15:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,吵死了 你才是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.72,0:15:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.85,0:15:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,雷神剑不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.56,0:16:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,看来到此为止了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.11,0:16:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下把你解决之后
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.70,0:16:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,再慢慢收下雷神剑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.08,0:16:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,雷神剑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.08,0:16:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好重
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.25,0:16:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,刃每天都背着这么重的剑吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.51,0:16:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,影虎 拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.43,0:16:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,等等我 刃
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.57,0:16:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不要过来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.62,0:17:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,死了这条心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.18,0:17:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.57,0:17:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,真是冥顽不灵啊 雷霆男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.50,0:17:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.29,0:17:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,旋风剑来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.96,0:17:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.22,0:17:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,旋风…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.10,0:18:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.77,0:18:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,别想把那颗珠子拔出来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.36,0:18:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,旋风剑是把手指插进洞里的技巧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.32,0:18:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,把洞堵住就无法耍花招了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.16,0:18:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,就算不能用旋风剑
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.12,0:18:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我还是要砍了你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.20,0:18:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.75,0:18:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,别在那边逞强了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.78,0:18:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.99,0:18:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.53,0:19:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,游戏结束了 雷霆男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.21,0:19:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,要被打倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.08,0:19:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安咯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.46,0:19:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.84,0:19:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.48,0:19:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.62,0:19:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.96,0:19:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.77,0:20:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,朝阳让珠子碎掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.23,0:20:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.19,0:20:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,机会来了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.65,0:20:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,旋风剑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.50,0:20:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.97,0:20:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,成功了 刃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.60,0:20:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好你赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.39,0:20:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,别靠近我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.77,0:20:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在没空理女人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.73,0:20:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,奇怪的人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.70,0:21:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.91,0:21:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这次还真是遇到大麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.75,0:21:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我说刃啊 你不吃点东西吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.13,0:21:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,大概是察觉到自己的不足了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.09,0:21:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,大事不妙呱 快看这个呱
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.89,0:21:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么？鬼的馒头？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.31,0:21:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是普通的馒头
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.77,0:21:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是鬼丸大人的馒头
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.89,0:21:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.65,0:21:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}是在那家店里看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.19,0:21:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（鬼丸馒头 吃了变聪明）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.15,0:21:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你们看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.53,0:21:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}鬼丸现在已经占领了国会议事堂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.03,0:21:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}全国各地也出现了他的支持者
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.99,0:21:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}联名商品和地方限定美食\N也正快速扩散中
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.58,0:21:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,可恶的鬼丸
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.41,0:21:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,得在他的影响力继续扩大前
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.00,0:21:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,赶快前往岩流岛才行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.67,0:21:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,要更强
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.09,0:22:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,一定要变得更强才行
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.27,0:23:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,终于抵达岩流岛了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.23,0:23:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,结果一放松下来…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.61,0:23:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不会吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.61,0:23:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到竟然会发生这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.78,0:23:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,刃
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.61,0:23:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,下集 小次郎复活
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.57,0:23:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,大…大事不妙
